WEBVTT

00:09:56.503 --> 00:10:02.089
80,000 individuals are good enough
to control one acre,

00:10:02.113 --> 00:10:03.951
4,000 square meters,

00:10:03.975 --> 00:10:05.828
of a strawberry plot

00:10:05.852 --> 00:10:08.781
against spider mites for the whole season

00:10:08.805 --> 00:10:10.218
of almost one year.

00:10:10.982 --> 00:10:14.530
And we can produce
from this, believe you me,

00:10:14.554 --> 00:10:18.956
several dozens of kilograms
on an annual basis.

00:10:18.980 --> 00:10:23.188
So this is what I call
amplification of the phenomenon.

00:10:23.212 --> 00:10:27.011
And no, we do not disrupt the balance.

00:10:27.035 --> 00:10:28.276
On the contrary,

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.183
because we bring it to every cultural plot